kepada Allah. Dan Allah Maha Mengetahui, Mahabijaksana."},{"resource_id":999,"language_name":"gorontalo","text":"Wau diila paatuti ta mu'umini ngota u ma'o momate olo ta mu'umini wuweewo ngopohiiya lo'u tio o totala, wau titaalo-tita ta lomatema'o olo ta mu'umini to'u tala-tala yi tolotio bo momulima'o wato ngota mu'umini u momaayarima'o toloto u wohilioma'o ode o gaala'alio lo ta pilate ngopohiiya timongolio (o ngaala'a lo ta pilate) moposadaka . Wanu ta pilate boito mondo kaumu u mumuusua wolimongoli tohuhama lo'u tio palasaya, yi ta yilomate momulima'o wato ngota ta mu'umini. Wanu ta pilate boito mondo kaumu lo ta kaapiru u o daandia modame wolimongoli, yi ta yilomate olio bo momaayarima'o tolota u wohilioma'o ode o ngaala'a lo ta pilate wau momulima'o wato m'umini ngota. Wau titaalo-tita ta diila mo'otoduo (wato boito) yi ta yilomate boito mopuasama'o duulo hula mohuumbuta toobati olio mondo Allah wau Allah labatutu motota boli o poongilalo."}]},{"id":586,"verse_number":93,"verse_key":"4:93","hizb_number":10,"rub_el_hizb_number":37,"ruku_number":74,"manzil_number":1,"sajdah_number":null,"chapter_id":4,"page_number":93,"juz_number":5,"words":[{"id":69300,"position":1,"audio_url":"wbw/004_093_001.mp3","char_type_name":"word","line_number":8,"location":"4:93:1","code_v1":"ﮓ","code_v2":"ﲃ","text_uthmani":"وَمَن","text_indopak":"وَمَنۡ","page_number":93,"text":"ﲃ","translation":{"text":"And whoever","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"waman","language_name":"english"}},{"id":69301,"position":2,"audio_url":"wbw/004_093_002.mp3","char_type_name":"word","line_number":8,"location":"4:93:2","code_v1":"ﮔ","code_v2":"ﲄ","text_uthmani":"يَقْتُلْ","text_indopak":"يَّقۡتُلۡ","page_number":93,"text":"ﲄ","translation":{"text":"kills","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"yaqtul","language_name":"english"}},{"id":69302,"position":3,"audio_url":"wbw/004_093_003.mp3","char_type_name":"word","line_number":8,"location":"4:93:3","code_v1":"ﮕ","code_v2